        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Joo-mi, Jin Se-yeon, Go Soo, Kim Mi-sook, Jung Joon-ho, Yoon Joo-hee, Jun Kwang-ryul, Choi Tae-joon\n- Companies: Asiana Airlines\n- Places: Seoul, Asiana Town building\n- Products: Beautiful Seoul, Feels Good, Flowers of the Prison\n- Topics: acting careers, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Park Joo-mi made her entertainment debut as an Asiana Airlines model before beginning acting in 1991.\n- Asiana Airlines has its headquarters in the Asiana Town building in Seoul.\n- Park Joo-mi starred in the television drama \"Beautiful Seoul\" in 1999.\n- Park Joo-mi starred in the television drama \"Feels Good\" in 2000.\n- \"Flowers of the Prison\" is a 2016 South Korean television series.\n- \"Flowers of the Prison\" stars Jin Se-yeon, Go Soo, Kim Mi-sook, Jung Joon-ho, Park Joo-mi, Yoon Joo-hee, Jun Kwang-ryul, and Choi Tae-joon.",
